<title>TURKMENISTAN: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TURKMENISTAN 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TURKMENISTAN 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat Turkmenistan 4-1</p>
<p>(half-time 2-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - Peng Weiguo 25 40, Gao Feng 80, Li Bing 85</p>
<p>Turkmenistan - Dzhuma Meredov 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
</text>
